
### USER REGISTRATION API
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"adith",
    "email":"adith@gmail.com",
    "password":"adith@123"
}

### USER LOGIN API
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"alex",
    "password":"alex@123"
}

### API FOR DISPLAYING NOTES
GET  http://127.0.0.1:8000/notes/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Token cc56502f054d40734b75bced606ba4decab381c0

### API FOR CREATING NOTES
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/notes/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token cc56502f054d40734b75bced606ba4decab381c0

{
    "title":"Python",
    "description":"Python is a simple, high-level, easy to learn language."
}

### JWT LOGIN
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/jwt_login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"alex",
    "password":"alex@123"
}

